@vishaykhol :observed something important. When you spoke about stardom and accessibility, the way you conducted the discussion itself felt like the first problem. It seemed as though you personally were not ready to acknowledge their stardom.

The way you addressed them was inappropriate. Personal friendship and closeness should remain off camera. When you referred to Mithila as “Mithu” in a formal setting, it took away from her stature…audiences won’t perceive her as someone special.

Honestly, I’m disappointed that all the actresses allowed this. Building an aura starts with self-respect..you don’t accept such behavior from anyone.
